				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]は
試しの岩を　壊そうとした！▼
岩の　一部が　砕け
すなと　なって　落ちた！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T09:46:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・アイテム入手処理
　No090「ほしのすな」
※swanで入手アイテム変更</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T09:46:52" />
		</CommentCell>
